{"id":"658520","name":"葱烧豆腐","author":"美食家3998N_bkoa","authorId":"13061039","desc":"","cover":"images/658520/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆腐","amount":"200克"}],"sub":[{"name":"青辣椒","amount":"沂"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"豆腐用手挷成小块。","img":"images/658520/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放在盘子里备用。","img":"images/658520/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"大葱切成马踢状青辣椒切成小块。","img":"images/658520/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅里放油热后倒入豆腐。","img":"images/658520/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"炸成两面金黄装在盘子里备用。","img":"images/658520/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅里留底油下葱段煸炒出香味。","img":"images/658520/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"小碗里放松茸鲜。","img":"images/658520/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"辣椒油。","img":"images/658520/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"红烧酱油适量。","img":"images/658520/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入少量开水搅匀。","img":"images/658520/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入豆腐和调料及青辣椒块。","img":"images/658520/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"慢炖20分钟。","img":"images/658520/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/658520/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}